{"availability":"available","full":"roccoterr97/threadline","name":"threadline","description":"Every conversation, one clear line. A self-hosted tracker that reads your mailbox (and LinkedIn) every morning and tells you who is waiting for whom.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T12:35:47Z","updated":"2026-10-09T19:34:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://try-threadline.vercel.app","topics":["claude-code","email-tracker","follow-up","fundraising","gmail","job-search","linkedin","networking","outlook","outreach","personal-crm","relationship-tracker","sales","self-hosted","supabase"],"demo":"https://demo.threadlineapp.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:04.822Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:04.822Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:04.822Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:35:04.822Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Threadline is a private, self-hosted tool for the conversations you are keeping alive: who you are talking to, where each conversation stands, who owes whom a reply, and what to do next.","Once a day it reads your new LinkedIn messages and your mailbox (Gmail, Outlook.com, iCloud, Yahoo, Fastmail or any IMAP mailbox), plus your Outlook calendar if you have one, throws away the noise, and groups what is left into one timeline per person. An AI step, run by Claude on your own subscription, then judges each person: the status, who is waiting on whom, the next action and when it is due. You see the result on a private dashboard, and a short summary e-mail reaches you every morning, when a mailbox that can send it is connected (for example Gmail with an app password)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/roccoterr97/threadline/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d2a08b5a75b42e16e8388ea8730adc6398c0bccac87b84932c4949386266296f","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:04.892Z"},"